flowchart TB
  accTitle: Claude Code built-in workflows and optional skills
  accDescr: Superpowers organizes design, implementation, and verification. Code Review and Simplifier inspect and simplify code. Karpathy Skills emphasize small changes and explicit assumptions. Research skills require checking each plugin and its commands; there is no universal ars command set.
  subgraph workflow["Superpowers · Development workflow"]
    direction LR
    design["Explore requirements<br/>and write a plan"]
    develop["Test before implementation<br/>and debug systematically"]
    verify["Run verification<br/>before claiming completion"]
    design --> develop --> verify
  end
  subgraph quality["Code Review & Simplifier · Code quality"]
    direction LR
    review["Review the current diff<br/>/code-review"]
    fix["Review and fix issues<br/>/code-review --fix"]
    simplify["Reduce duplication and complexity<br/>/simplify"]
    review --> fix --> simplify
  end
  subgraph principles["Karpathy Skills · Coding guidelines"]
    direction LR
    simple["Avoid over-engineering<br/>and keep code simple"]
    scope["Limit the scope<br/>and make small changes"]
    explicit["Surface assumptions<br/>and define verifiable criteria"]
    simple ~~~ scope ~~~ explicit
  end
  subgraph research["Research skills · Verify the provider"]
    direction LR
    plan["Check repository and maintainer<br/>Read the installation instructions"]
    write["Confirm available commands<br/>Use them for project needs"]
    revise["Check output and sources<br/>Keep human review"]
    plan --> write --> revise
  end
  workflow ~~~ quality ~~~ principles ~~~ research
